1 0 obj<</Author(notstilinski)/CreationDate(D:20261101012956+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, General Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Bow/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Perfuma \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Alternate Universe - Modern Setting, Mutual Pining, Friends to Lovers, This was written at midnight please be kind, Also they don't actually quite get to lovers but feelings are hinted at, But I'm a slut for that trope and these two so I had to do it, The fic fits into the universe from my previous She-ra fic, F/F, F/M, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, No Archive Warnings Apply, Was this just a writing exercise? It might be, no beta readers we die like men)/ModDate(D:20261101012956+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Carnation)>>
